  "description": ".NET Source generator for high performance interface-based generics-capable P/Invoke, useful in unit testing, supports lazy module loading, invokes using calli opcode (delegate* for zero marshalling), no DllImport, no runtime dependency, no reflection, no dynamic codegen, cross-platform and AOT/JIT-friendly via NativeLibrary API",
